{
  "anomaly_detected": true,
  "confidence": 0.85,
  "anomalies": [
    {
      "category": "wrong_value",
      "components": ["C2"],
      "pins": ["C2.1", "C2.2", "U1.2"],
      "nets": ["+5V", "GND"],
      "observed": "C2 is a 100nF capacitor connected between +5V and GND, serving as the output capacitor for U1 (LM1117-5.0).",
      "expected": "The LM1117-5.0 datasheet requires an output capacitor of at least 10 µF for stability. C2 should be 10 µF or larger.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(comp (ref \"C2\") (value \"100nF\") (footprint \"Capacitor_SMD:C_0805_2012Metric\")"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"1\") (name \"+5V\") (node (ref \"C2\") (pin \"1\") (pintype \"passive\")) (node (ref \"U1\") (pin \"2\") (pinfunction \"VO\") (pintype \"power_out\"))"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(comp (ref \"U1\") (value \"LM1117-5.0\") (datasheet \"http://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/lm1117.pdf\")"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "The 5V linear regulator may oscillate or be unstable, causing the +5V rail to be noisy or out of regulation. This can lead to malfunction or reset of the ATtiny microcontroller and any I2C devices powered from +5V.",
      "confidence": 0.9
    },
    {
      "category": "footprint_mismatch",
      "components": ["U3"],
      "pins": [],
      "nets": [],
      "observed": "U3 is specified as an ATtiny13V-10S but uses footprint Package_SO:SOIC-8W_5.3x5.3mm_P1.27mm, which is a 5.3mm wide SOIC-8.",
      "expected": "The ATtiny13V-10S (8S2 package) is a 0.150\" (3.9mm) wide SOIC-8. The footprint should be a standard SOIC-8 3.9x4.9mm (e.g., Package_SO:SOIC-8_3.9x4.9mm_P1.27mm).",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(comp (ref \"U3\") (value \"ATtiny13V-10S\") (footprint \"Package_SO:SOIC-8W_5.3x5.3mm_P1.27mm\")"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(field (name \"Datasheet\") \"http://ww1.microchip.com/downloads/en/DeviceDoc/doc2535.pdf\")"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "If U3 is populated, the ATtiny13V-10S will not fit the 5.3mm-wide SOIC footprint, preventing correct assembly. The board may be unusable if U3 is the selected MCU.",
      "confidence": 0.8
    }
  ],
  "summary": "The design files contain two anomalies: the output capacitor C2 for the LM1117-5.0 regulator is 100nF instead of the required ≥10µF, risking regulator instability; and U3 (ATtiny13V-10S) uses a 5.3mm-wide SOIC footprint that does not match the part's 3.9mm-wide SOIC package."
}

